          "ruleId": "CWE-918",
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "Second-order SSRF: an unvalidated subscriberUrl supplied to the API v1 webhook create endpoint is persisted to the database and later fetched by the webhook dispatcher (sendPayload.ts:373) with no SSRF re-validation on the dispatch path. The API v1 create body schema leaves subscriberUrl as a bare z.string() (the URL/SSRF refine is commented out at apps/api/v1/lib/validations/webhook.ts:18), so the write-time control that protects the tRPC and API v2 creation paths is absent on the v1 path."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "packages/features/webhooks/lib/sendPayload.ts"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 373
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "codeFlows": [
            {
              "threadFlows": [
                {
                  "locations": [
                    {
                      "location": {
                        "physicalLocation": {
                          "artifactLocation": {
                            "uri": "apps/api/v1/pages/api/webhooks/_post.ts"
                          },
                          "region": {
                            "startLine": 70
                          }
                        },
                        "message": {
                          "text": "source: req.body parsed by schemaWebhookCreateBodyParams; subscriberUrl is only z.string() (SSRF/url refine commented out at apps/api/v1/lib/validations/webhook.ts:18)"
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "location": {
                        "physicalLocation": {
                          "artifactLocation": {
                            "uri": "apps/api/v1/pages/api/webhooks/_post.ts"
                          },
                          "region": {
                            "startLine": 102
                          }
                        },
                        "message": {
                          "text": "hop: tainted-write leg - prisma.webhook.create(args) persists the unvalidated subscriberUrl"
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "location": {
                        "physicalLocation": {
                          "artifactLocation": {
                            "uri": "packages/features/webhooks/lib/sendPayload.ts"
                          },
                          "region": {
                            "startLine": 358
                          }
                        },
                        "message": {
                          "text": "hop: read-to-sink leg - const { subscriberUrl } = webhook loaded from the DB-sourced webhook payload"
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "location": {
                        "physicalLocation": {
                          "artifactLocation": {
                            "uri": "packages/features/webhooks/lib/sendPayload.ts"
                          },
                          "region": {
                            "startLine": 373
                          }
                        },
                        "message": {
                          "text": "sink: fetch(subscriberUrl, ...) issues a server-side request to the attacker-controlled URL with no local SSRF validation"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
            "gateBlocking": true,
            "severity": "error",
            "exploitScenario": "An attacker holding a valid API key POSTs to /api/v1/webhooks with subscriberUrl=http://169.254.169.254/latest/meta-data/iam/security-credentials/. Because the v1 create body schema validates subscriberUrl as a bare string (the z.string().url()/SSRF refine is commented out at apps/api/v1/lib/validations/webhook.ts:18), the value is persisted verbatim by prisma.webhook.create (_post.ts:102). On the next matching trigger, sendPayload.ts:358 reads the stored subscriberUrl and sendPayload.ts:373 calls fetch(subscriberUrl) server-side, reaching the cloud metadata endpoint and returning instance credentials - full SSRF to internal/metadata services.",
            "confidence": "high",
            "confidenceReason": "Both legs of the second-order flow are evidenced in-repo (tainted write at v1 _post.ts:102; read-to-sink at sendPayload.ts:358->373), and the write-time SSRF control present on every sibling creation path is demonstrably absent on the v1 path.",
            "sanitizersEncountered": [],
            "demotionBasis": "none - no on-path control neutralizes this finding",
            "intermediateHopsSummary": "Second-order (DB-laundered) taint with BOTH legs evidenced. Tainted-write leg: apps/api/v1/pages/api/webhooks/_post.ts:70 (req.body via schemaWebhookCreateBodyParams; subscriberUrl unrefined) -> :102 prisma.webhook.create persists the value. Read-to-sink leg: packages/features/webhooks/lib/sendPayload.ts:358 reads subscriberUrl from the DB-sourced webhook -> :373 fetch(subscriberUrl).",
            "cwe": "CWE-918",
            "siblingConsistency": "Anchor control validateUrlForSSRFSync (packages/lib/ssrfProtection.ts:196) is applied at webhook write-time on every sibling creation path - tRPC create.handler.ts:28, edit.handler.ts:38, testTrigger.handler.ts:18, and API v2 validate-webhook-url.ts:5 - but the API v1 _post.ts creation path applies no equivalent validator (the refine is commented out at validations/webhook.ts:18). Confirmed sibling gap; the shared dispatch sink sendPayload.ts:373 performs no re-validation."
          }
        },
