          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "Open redirect: the Edge middleware builds a redirect target with new URL(returnTo.value, base) from the attacker-controllable return-to cookie and issues NextResponse.redirect (proxy.ts:86). Because new URL(value, base) follows an absolute value and ignores base, there is no same-origin enforcement, and getSafeRedirectUrl is not applied on this path (the cookie is only .delete()'d at proxy.ts:89)."
          },
