            "sanitizersEncountered": [],
            "demotionBasis": "none - no on-path control neutralizes this finding",
            "intermediateHopsSummary": "Single-hop first-order flow: proxy.ts:83 reads the return-to cookie -> proxy.ts:86 NextResponse.redirect(new URL(returnTo.value, base)). The base argument is ignored when returnTo.value is absolute; the cookie is only deleted at :89, never validated.",
            "cwe": "CWE-601",
            "siblingConsistency": "Anchor control getSafeRedirectUrl (packages/lib/getSafeRedirectUrl.ts:5) is used by other redirect builders in apps/web to enforce safe/same-origin targets, but this Edge middleware return-to path constructs the redirect with a raw new URL() and does not call it - confirmed sibling gap on a redirect sink."
